OL,3,AJapan beer giants raided over alleged
OL,4,Aprice-fixing cartel
OL,5,
OL,6,FJapanese officials have raided the
OL,7,Fcountry's biggest beer makers over
OL,8,Fallegations they worked together to
OL,9,Fraise the price of their beverages.
OL,11,FAsahi and Kirin confirmed to the BBC
OL,12,Ftheir premises had been searched by the
OL,13,FJapan Fair Trade Commission, adding
OL,14,Fthat they would fully cooperate with
OL,15,Fthe government authority.
OL,17,FThere are reports Sapporo Breweries and
OL,18,FSuntory Spirits were also raided. Both
OL,19,Ffirms have been contacted for comment.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
